(1542760, 204084, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed shot, but IMHO when a shot is this close-up, the DOF has to be really sharp.  This is a little blurry &amp; grainy, while just around the eyes is in pretty good focus - at least on my monitor.</td>', 'Beautifully composed shot, but IMHO when a shot is this close-up, the DOF has to be really sharp.  This is a little blurry & grainy, while just around the eyes is in pretty good focus - at least on my monitor.', '2005-07-18 02:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542761, 204875, 15032, '<td valign="top">Great shot and excellent framing.  The crop is excellent.  The only thing that gets me a bit is that one of the blurred lines in the background lines up with the natural line down the middle of the face, maybe I would have cloned it out.  But overall, a great shot!  Top ten for sure.</td>', 'Great shot and excellent framing.  The crop is excellent.  The only thing that gets me a bit is that one of the blurred lines in the background lines up with the natural line down the middle of the face, maybe I would have cloned it out.  But overall, a great shot!  Top ten for sure.', '2005-07-18 02:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542765, 204029, 35467, '<td valign="top">Nice detail. Good luck</td>', 'Nice detail. Good luck', '2005-07-18 02:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542777, 203730, 35467, '<td valign="top">Nice detail, the shadows cast are a little distracting. Well done. Good luck</td>', 'Nice detail, the shadows cast are a little distracting. Well done. Good luck', '2005-07-18 02:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542781, 204620, 34659, '<td valign="top">Really great shot!  Beautiful DOF and natural colors.  The only thing I thought was a teensy bit distracting was the white/hot spots on the bird''s breast.  Very minor detail though - 9</td>', 'Really great shot!  Beautiful DOF and natural colors.  The only thing I thought was a teensy bit distracting was the white/hot spots on the bird''s breast.  Very minor detail though - 9', '2005-07-18 02:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542787, 205253, 35467, '<td valign="top">The shot I could not get! Well done. Good luck</td>', 'The shot I could not get! Well done. Good luck', '2005-07-18 02:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542788, 204141, 34659, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful colors - almost surreal.  I like the soft focus, but IMHO it''s a tad overprocessed.  Only a minor point with such a fantastic shot.  Great job.  9</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful colors - almost surreal.  I like the soft focus, but IMHO it''s a tad overprocessed.  Only a minor point with such a fantastic shot.  Great job.  9', '2005-07-18 02:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542792, 204790, 39484, '<td valign="top">Beautifully framed. 10</td>', 'Beautifully framed. 10', '2005-07-18 02:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542796, 205363, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful natural colors and great DOF on the turtle''s head &amp; legs.  Only distractions to me (and it''s a very minor thing) are the hot spot on the turtle''s back and the DOF at the back of the little guy.  Still, a wonderful &amp; beautifully composed shot!  9</td>', 'Beautiful natural colors and great DOF on the turtle''s head & legs.  Only distractions to me (and it''s a very minor thing) are the hot spot on the turtle''s back and the DOF at the back of the little guy.  Still, a wonderful & beautifully composed shot!  9', '2005-07-18 02:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542803, 203613, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is a spectacular image - beautifully composed!  One thing that distracted me (and it may be that I''m imagining it) is that the face looks very processed.  It''s so soft (almost airbrushed) compared to the wonderful DOF everywhere else.  Maybe it''s the breed of monkey, but I don''t think so.  Still, a fantastic shot.  8</td>', 'This is a spectacular image - beautifully composed!  One thing that distracted me (and it may be that I''m imagining it) is that the face looks very processed.  It''s so soft (almost airbrushed) compared to the wonderful DOF everywhere else.  Maybe it''s the breed of monkey, but I don''t think so.  Still, a fantastic shot.  8', '2005-07-18 02:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542807, 204976, 34659, '<td valign="top">Was this shot through glass?  There appears to be almost a film over the whole image.  Don''t get me wrong - it''s a fantastic shot.  Beautiful composition and priceless expression.  The highlights are a little strong on the wood too.  BUT, these are very minor points about a really great capture.  8</td>', 'Was this shot through glass?  There appears to be almost a film over the whole image.  Don''t get me wrong - it''s a fantastic shot.  Beautiful composition and priceless expression.  The highlights are a little strong on the wood too.  BUT, these are very minor points about a really great capture.  8', '2005-07-18 02:56:28.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1542814, 205111, 34659, '<td valign="top">Cute capture, but it seems overprocessed to me.  The contrast is turned up so high that you can''t see the animal''s eye or mouth and the highlights are blown out.  It''s a nicely composed shot and I love the boy''s expresion, but the overprocessing is distracting IMHO.</td>', 'Cute capture, but it seems overprocessed to me.  The contrast is turned up so high that you can''t see the animal''s eye or mouth and the highlights are blown out.  It''s a nicely composed shot and I love the boy''s expresion, but the overprocessing is distracting IMHO.', '2005-07-18 02:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542819, 202861, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great idea and good DOF on the foreground.  I like your composition, but think that if the gorilla was a little more visible the image might have a stronger impact.  As it is, he/she is almost lost - and I realize that conscious artistic choices were made to "hide" him/her in the "jungle" as would be found in the real world, but I think you could still get that point across with a little more visibility.  Still, it''s a very powerful image - full of emotion.  Nice job.</td>', 'Great idea and good DOF on the foreground.  I like your composition, but think that if the gorilla was a little more visible the image might have a stronger impact.  As it is, he/she is almost lost - and I realize that conscious artistic choices were made to "hide" him/her in the "jungle" as would be found in the real world, but I think you could still get that point across with a little more visibility.  Still, it''s a very powerful image - full of emotion.  Nice job.', '2005-07-18 03:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542824, 204580, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great DOF and color on the emu.</td>', 'Great DOF and color on the emu.', '2005-07-18 03:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542825, 205359, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very emotional shot.  Great DOF and composition.  The white hairs and background may be a little blown out IMHO, but not a big factor with such a great capture.  8</td>', 'Very emotional shot.  Great DOF and composition.  The white hairs and background may be a little blown out IMHO, but not a big factor with such a great capture.  8', '2005-07-18 03:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542836, 205098, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  Love the composition, but the highlights seem blown out to me - just a tad too bright, causing some loss of DOF.  Very emotional shot though - Nice job.</td>', 'Great capture.  Love the composition, but the highlights seem blown out to me - just a tad too bright, causing some loss of DOF.  Very emotional shot though - Nice job.', '2005-07-18 03:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542838, 204343, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and color.  Pretty good DOF too.  Really nice capture.</td>', 'Beautiful composition and color.  Pretty good DOF too.  Really nice capture.', '2005-07-18 03:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542839, 205046, 34659, '<td valign="top">Really good DOF.  Like the colors &amp; reflection too.  Nice job!</td>', 'Really good DOF.  Like the colors & reflection too.  Nice job!', '2005-07-18 03:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542848, 203359, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is a worthy photo but diminished by the stark and (probably over processed) backgound and by the reflection. Nice commercial art and I can visualize it in an ad, but not here.</td>', 'This is a worthy photo but diminished by the stark and (probably over processed) backgound and by the reflection. Nice commercial art and I can visualize it in an ad, but not here.', '2005-07-18 03:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542852, 205219, 35467, '<td valign="top">Brillant. Good luck</td>', 'Brillant. Good luck', '2005-07-18 03:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542881, 205461, 25655, '<td valign="top">Out of the box! niiiice.<br/>Ok, i gotta admit I don''t think the zoo has such lovely plates for the snaks, but personally I love this idea a lot more then most of the other pics in the challenge. <br/>Also, I think the BG is a bit blown out. I would love to see some details in it. 8</td>', 'Out of the box! niiiice.Ok, i gotta admit I don''t think the zoo has such lovely plates for the snaks, but personally I love this idea a lot more then most of the other pics in the challenge. Also, I think the BG is a bit blown out. I would love to see some details in it. 8', '2005-07-18 03:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542884, 205219, 24681, '<td valign="top">I can''t seem to take my eyes off this one. There''s something about it that makes one stop...and really look. Well-captured. Am sure it will do very well! Good luck!</td>', 'I can''t seem to take my eyes off this one. There''s something about it that makes one stop...and really look. Well-captured. Am sure it will do very well! Good luck!', '2005-07-18 03:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542887, 204948, 25655, '<td valign="top">The expressions those giraffes have are just hillarious! I love it!<br/>Wish it wasn''t so dead center, but still a great take!</td>', 'The expressions those giraffes have are just hillarious! I love it!Wish it wasn''t so dead center, but still a great take!', '2005-07-18 03:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542889, 205363, 25655, '<td valign="top">where''s it gonna jump??? Cool shot! :-D</td>', 'where''s it gonna jump??? Cool shot! :-D', '2005-07-18 03:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542892, 205362, 25655, '<td valign="top">nice idea. Funny and refreshing. I like!</td>', 'nice idea. Funny and refreshing. I like!', '2005-07-18 03:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542897, 205173, 25655, '<td valign="top">I''m not taking points off my vote for a title, but I think your title''s not as good as it should. Try loosin the explanation in it. A simple "A Face only a Mother Could Love " would do better IMO. <br/>As for the shot - nice. A bit under exposed and not details on the black part, but I like the pose of the bird and the DOF.<br/>over all a very nice take on the challenge.<br/></td>', 'I''m not taking points off my vote for a title, but I think your title''s not as good as it should. Try loosin the explanation in it. A simple "A Face only a Mother Could Love " would do better IMO. As for the shot - nice. A bit under exposed and not details on the black part, but I like the pose of the bird and the DOF.over all a very nice take on the challenge.', '2005-07-18 03:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542898, 202861, 25655, '<td valign="top">Different, bold, interesting! i just love it! 10</td>', 'Different, bold, interesting! i just love it! 10', '2005-07-18 03:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542901, 203143, 25655, '<td valign="top">ahh, I already hear the llama song in my head... hillarious!!!</td>', 'ahh, I already hear the llama song in my head... hillarious!!!', '2005-07-18 03:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542904, 205461, 16406, '<td valign="top">... I suppose this image is just a big mistake :D nice but not the right contest</td>', '... I suppose this image is just a big mistake :D nice but not the right contest', '2005-07-18 03:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542905, 203359, 25655, '<td valign="top">the reflection looks wrong. like you have burnt the entire background out. <br/>Not sure I like this black on black, but over all the image is nice. <br/></td>', 'the reflection looks wrong. like you have burnt the entire background out. Not sure I like this black on black, but over all the image is nice. ', '2005-07-18 03:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542907, 205100, 25655, '<td valign="top">umm...wrong challenge ;-)<br/>Just beautiful! And I would definately vote this in the family challenge just as high as I do now! 8</td>', 'umm...wrong challenge ;-)Just beautiful! And I would definately vote this in the family challenge just as high as I do now! 8', '2005-07-18 03:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542917, 202861, 37252, '<td valign="top">your subject is too hidden - almost to the point of not being noticed.</td>', 'your subject is too hidden - almost to the point of not being noticed.', '2005-07-18 04:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542918, 205051, 18552, '<td valign="top">She does have lovely eye lashes!</td>', 'She does have lovely eye lashes!', '2005-07-18 04:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542919, 204585, 37252, '<td valign="top">I would suggest sharpening the image, and not cropping so much on the bottom - would have liked to see past the end of the beak just a bit</td>', 'I would suggest sharpening the image, and not cropping so much on the bottom - would have liked to see past the end of the beak just a bit', '2005-07-18 04:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542923, 204788, 37252, '<td valign="top">the composition here is very nice. The color tones are well done here also. Just a little soft on the focus.  Overall, I love it - especially the way this bear lokos to be sticking his tongue out at his observers.  9</td>', 'the composition here is very nice. The color tones are well done here also. Just a little soft on the focus.  Overall, I love it - especially the way this bear lokos to be sticking his tongue out at his observers.  9', '2005-07-18 04:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542929, 205423, 37252, '<td valign="top">the colors seem washed out.</td>', 'the colors seem washed out.', '2005-07-18 04:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542930, 205368, 37252, '<td valign="top">what a great shot. Good timing.</td>', 'what a great shot. Good timing.', '2005-07-18 04:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542932, 203613, 33352, '<td valign="top">Sharpness,contrast,colors, work well in this image, I like how the texture of the fur has been captured....10</td>', 'Sharpness,contrast,colors, work well in this image, I like how the texture of the fur has been captured....10', '2005-07-18 04:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542935, 205226, 33352, '<td valign="top">Nice Image at the right time...7</td>', 'Nice Image at the right time...7', '2005-07-18 04:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542943, 205079, 37252, '<td valign="top">not sure if it is the over-processing, or if I truly am looking at a fox back from the taxidermist.</td>', 'not sure if it is the over-processing, or if I truly am looking at a fox back from the taxidermist.', '2005-07-18 04:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542972, 204701, 35467, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Good luck</td>', 'Very nice. Good luck', '2005-07-18 05:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542975, 204976, 33352, '<td valign="top">This image would be better without the green leaf over the ape,  the dark amd light contrast is good, IMO....7</td>', 'This image would be better without the green leaf over the ape,  the dark amd light contrast is good, IMO....7', '2005-07-18 05:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542979, 204585, 40543, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the bird and the background, very vivid. For my taste the neck of the bird could be a little more in focus but I think it''s a great shot, obviously focussing on the head.  Good stuff :)</td>', 'I like the contrast between the bird and the background, very vivid. For my taste the neck of the bird could be a little more in focus but I think it''s a great shot, obviously focussing on the head.  Good stuff :)', '2005-07-18 05:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542981, 204827, 35467, '<td valign="top">Something not quite right, the color looks wrong, maybe too much saturation or usm adjustment?? I scored it well anyway. Good luck</td>', 'Something not quite right, the color looks wrong, maybe too much saturation or usm adjustment?? I scored it well anyway. Good luck', '2005-07-18 06:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542984, 204946, 33352, '<td valign="top">Agressive image with good contrast &amp; texture....7</td>', 'Agressive image with good contrast & texture....7', '2005-07-18 06:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542997, 203730, 16970, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Good exposure.  I hope you do  well in the challenge.</td>', 'Great shot.  Good exposure.  I hope you do  well in the challenge.', '2005-07-18 06:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543002, 202814, 16970, '<td valign="top">We have a winner ;)  Just beautiful.  At least if you don''t win you will have a great print to sell.  Congrats.</td>', 'We have a winner ;)  Just beautiful.  At least if you don''t win you will have a great print to sell.  Congrats.', '2005-07-18 06:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543004, 205446, 16970, '<td valign="top">Fantastic.  Well lit (not that you had control of that) .  A1 exposure.  Not out of place in Nat Geo. Only one thing is anoying....  it''s a shame the top is cut off.</td>', 'Fantastic.  Well lit (not that you had control of that) .  A1 exposure.  Not out of place in Nat Geo. Only one thing is anoying....  it''s a shame the top is cut off.', '2005-07-18 06:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543048, 205078, 39850, '<td valign="top">''9'' - This is a great photograph.  Excellent capture.  Perfect natural lighting.  Beautiful colors.  The only possible criticism I could offer, in my opinion, would be that possibly, a slight rotation to the left - and that is about it.  But that may throw out the ''shape'' of the body, not sure.  Possibly a tighter crop vertically, but that would make this ''another'' photograph (not a lesser one just different).  I do like the semi-elongation as it is, it emphasizes the height of the bird while not detracting from the central ''body''.  Again, even as a ''full length'' this would still be great.  It is the shape (and colors) of the body though, for me, that truly make this photograph so I think you have ''set'' that just about perfectly.  The dappled shade over the feathers makes this whole capture appear even softer.  Very nice.  Excellent opportunity and extremely well taken advantage of.</td>', '''9'' - This is a great photograph.  Excellent capture.  Perfect natural lighting.  Beautiful colors.  The only possible criticism I could offer, in my opinion, would be that possibly, a slight rotation to the left - and that is about it.  But that may throw out the ''shape'' of the body, not sure.  Possibly a tighter crop vertically, but that would make this ''another'' photograph (not a lesser one just different).  I do like the semi-elongation as it is, it emphasizes the height of the bird while not detracting from the central ''body''.  Again, even as a ''full length'' this would still be great.  It is the shape (and colors) of the body though, for me, that truly make this photograph so I think you have ''set'' that just about perfectly.  The dappled shade over the feathers makes this whole capture appear even softer.  Very nice.  Excellent opportunity and extremely well taken advantage of.', '2005-07-18 07:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543053, 205100, 35602, '<td valign="top">I have no ability to judge a photo because I can''t take a good picture.  So I am only voting based on whether I like the picture or not.  Sorry, but I just became a member which was a mistake so now I feel compelled to vote.</td>', 'I have no ability to judge a photo because I can''t take a good picture.  So I am only voting based on whether I like the picture or not.  Sorry, but I just became a member which was a mistake so now I feel compelled to vote.', '2005-07-18 07:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
