(1543400, 204246, 32792, '<td valign="top">All right! first vote on the first day ov voting, and my guess for 1st place!<br/>This has such an impact! The lil'' cub seems he''s about to cry! Yet this is such a cute creature! I feel like taking it back to its home. It doesn''t belong on a zoo!<br/>Perfect shot. A sure ribbon!</td>', 'All right! first vote on the first day ov voting, and my guess for 1st place!This has such an impact! The lil'' cub seems he''s about to cry! Yet this is such a cute creature! I feel like taking it back to its home. It doesn''t belong on a zoo!Perfect shot. A sure ribbon!', '2005-07-18 10:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543413, 203438, 15711, '<td valign="top">This image loses it''s impact because it''s so small. Maybe shoot with higher resolution so when you crop it, it''s still a decent sized image.</td>', 'This image loses it''s impact because it''s so small. Maybe shoot with higher resolution so when you crop it, it''s still a decent sized image.', '2005-07-18 10:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543417, 205423, 15711, '<td valign="top">This seems a bit blanched out due to lighting.  I like his detailing and your stop motion capture. I''d up the contrast a smidge as well as work on the lightness and you''d have a real winner.</td>', 'This seems a bit blanched out due to lighting.  I like his detailing and your stop motion capture. I''d up the contrast a smidge as well as work on the lightness and you''d have a real winner.', '2005-07-18 10:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543419, 204537, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. The light hitting his feathers on the top of his head is nice.  I''d zoom in so you could really appreciate the detailing of his pink around the beak!!</td>', 'Nice capture. The light hitting his feathers on the top of his head is nice.  I''d zoom in so you could really appreciate the detailing of his pink around the beak!!', '2005-07-18 10:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543423, 204863, 15711, '<td valign="top">I wish there were more lighting on the deer instead of the grassy area behind her.  I would crop part of her body and tighten the shot a bit as well.  The color and focus is well done though.</td>', 'I wish there were more lighting on the deer instead of the grassy area behind her.  I would crop part of her body and tighten the shot a bit as well.  The color and focus is well done though.', '2005-07-18 10:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
