(1543426, 204067, 15711, '<td valign="top">I wish this were a larger image so we could appreciate the detail of his shell and his striped neck and legs. The lighting is good but it doesn''t have the snap it needs being so small. :~(</td>', 'I wish this were a larger image so we could appreciate the detail of his shell and his striped neck and legs. The lighting is good but it doesn''t have the snap it needs being so small. :~(', '2005-07-18 10:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543428, 203359, 15711, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the cartoon look of the reflection. The swan is lovely and the coloration and detail is great. The black background shows off his red beak and the ilght on his back, but that reflection has me baffled. :~Z</td>', 'I don''t care for the cartoon look of the reflection. The swan is lovely and the coloration and detail is great. The black background shows off his red beak and the ilght on his back, but that reflection has me baffled. :~Z', '2005-07-18 10:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543430, 203029, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture. HIs eye and feather detail is good. I like your use of negative space - it gives the shot the impact I think you were going for. Nicely done.</td>', 'Very nice capture. HIs eye and feather detail is good. I like your use of negative space - it gives the shot the impact I think you were going for. Nicely done.', '2005-07-18 10:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
