(1543433, 204093, 15711, '<td valign="top">This seems a tad bit dull. I wish the colors had more oomph. It might have more impact with a dark background and the bird not centered in the middle.  The blurred tree in the background is a bit distracting.  Zooming in on his head and deleting part of his lower body and wings might work more effectively for this shot, so we could concentrate on his face. Hope this is helpful.</td>', 'This seems a tad bit dull. I wish the colors had more oomph. It might have more impact with a dark background and the bird not centered in the middle.  The blurred tree in the background is a bit distracting.  Zooming in on his head and deleting part of his lower body and wings might work more effectively for this shot, so we could concentrate on his face. Hope this is helpful.', '2005-07-18 10:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543434, 205079, 15711, '<td valign="top">This appears to be stuffed?? The background might present a better focus on the animal if it were dark. I like the shadow on his neck and back and the angle of the shot.</td>', 'This appears to be stuffed?? The background might present a better focus on the animal if it were dark. I like the shadow on his neck and back and the angle of the shot.', '2005-07-18 10:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543436, 205269, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really a nice crisp close up. His feathers, eye and beak are in great detail. I like this alot being a 3/4 profile shot.  Very nice lighting too. 8</td>', 'Really a nice crisp close up. His feathers, eye and beak are in great detail. I like this alot being a 3/4 profile shot.  Very nice lighting too. 8', '2005-07-18 10:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543437, 202828, 33672, '<td valign="top">I knew I''d have trouble competing in this comp. Yhis is a great shot with nice lighting and detail.</td>', 'I knew I''d have trouble competing in this comp. Yhis is a great shot with nice lighting and detail.', '2005-07-18 10:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543438, 205353, 15711, '<td valign="top">Maybe crop out some of the surrounding area and zoom in on their faces and the paw up on the other. It is an interesting perspecting and it might have a bit more pop that way. The focus, light and coloration is well done.</td>', 'Maybe crop out some of the surrounding area and zoom in on their faces and the paw up on the other. It is an interesting perspecting and it might have a bit more pop that way. The focus, light and coloration is well done.', '2005-07-18 10:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543440, 204320, 33672, '<td valign="top">Powerful shot.</td>', 'Powerful shot.', '2005-07-18 10:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543441, 205052, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup and details.   I''d blur out the background a tad more to bring him forward a bit more.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice closeup and details.   I''d blur out the background a tad more to bring him forward a bit more.  Well done.', '2005-07-18 10:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543446, 205452, 32767, '<td valign="top">Nice image but I can''t really make out what the beast is.</td>', 'Nice image but I can''t really make out what the beast is.', '2005-07-18 10:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543449, 205363, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail. Might have been a bit more interesting if shot from a diff angle. Maybe crop so he''s not dead center in the shot. I like the lighting and the coloration - very monochromatic.  7</td>', 'Very nice detail. Might have been a bit more interesting if shot from a diff angle. Maybe crop so he''s not dead center in the shot. I like the lighting and the coloration - very monochromatic.  7', '2005-07-18 10:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543450, 203815, 15711, '<td valign="top">Good use of texture and detail. The lighting is done nicely. You chose an interesting crop and I think it works here.</td>', 'Good use of texture and detail. The lighting is done nicely. You chose an interesting crop and I think it works here.', '2005-07-18 10:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543452, 205379, 32767, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. Good color depth but a tad oversaturated.</td>', 'Very nice image. Good color depth but a tad oversaturated.', '2005-07-18 10:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543453, 203753, 33672, '<td valign="top">A little oversaturated, but great comp and subject.</td>', 'A little oversaturated, but great comp and subject.', '2005-07-18 10:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543454, 205349, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great macro. I like the antennae drawing your eye to the left of the shot. The blurred green makes a nice backdrop to her coloring.  Good cropping job.  8</td>', 'Great macro. I like the antennae drawing your eye to the left of the shot. The blurred green makes a nice backdrop to her coloring.  Good cropping job.  8', '2005-07-18 10:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543456, 205391, 15711, '<td valign="top">I would sharpen the head even further. IT seems a tad grainy. GOod use of light and composition.</td>', 'I would sharpen the head even further. IT seems a tad grainy. GOod use of light and composition.', '2005-07-18 10:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543457, 205446, 15711, '<td valign="top">This might have more impact if shot from a different angle, using more negative space around the head and feathers. I like the coloring. Maybe off center the subject as well.</td>', 'This might have more impact if shot from a different angle, using more negative space around the head and feathers. I like the coloring. Maybe off center the subject as well.', '2005-07-18 10:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543458, 203957, 32767, '<td valign="top">Great crop. Beautiful color depth. Good Luck.</td>', 'Great crop. Beautiful color depth. Good Luck.', '2005-07-18 10:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543463, 205438, 33672, '<td valign="top">Powerful and emotive.  I''d prefer a little more crisp.</td>', 'Powerful and emotive.  I''d prefer a little more crisp.', '2005-07-18 11:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543466, 205373, 15711, '<td valign="top">This might be a fun shot to do with duotones.  His expression is great. In color, the grass is a bit dull but the overall composition is nicely shot.</td>', 'This might be a fun shot to do with duotones.  His expression is great. In color, the grass is a bit dull but the overall composition is nicely shot.', '2005-07-18 11:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543471, 205013, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice up shot.  It needs more contrast to really give it some POW. The sharpness could be brought up a tad as well.</td>', 'Nice up shot.  It needs more contrast to really give it some POW. The sharpness could be brought up a tad as well.', '2005-07-18 11:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543474, 204343, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this alot.  I wish it were a larger image. He seems just slightly out of focus.  The placement in the shot and the variation in color is nicely done. 7</td>', 'I like this alot.  I wish it were a larger image. He seems just slightly out of focus.  The placement in the shot and the variation in color is nicely done. 7', '2005-07-18 11:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543478, 205226, 15711, '<td valign="top">This might be more effective with some additional contrast. Black and white would be a nice filter for this shot as well.  The focus and detail is well shot.</td>', 'This might be more effective with some additional contrast. Black and white would be a nice filter for this shot as well.  The focus and detail is well shot.', '2005-07-18 11:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543482, 205065, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Great use of negative space. The lighting and detail is quite interesting. I like this very much. 9</td>', 'Very nice.  Great use of negative space. The lighting and detail is quite interesting. I like this very much. 9', '2005-07-18 11:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543486, 205254, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great crop.  The detail and use of black and white is perfect. The highlight on his snout is a good one. 9!</td>', 'Great crop.  The detail and use of black and white is perfect. The highlight on his snout is a good one. 9!', '2005-07-18 11:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543487, 204843, 15711, '<td valign="top">Talk about detail. WOW  The color is perfect as well.</td>', 'Talk about detail. WOW  The color is perfect as well.', '2005-07-18 11:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543492, 204141, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the softness to this shot.  The eye color is magnificent.  Your use of negative space is great - his black just fades into the background.  The lignting on his beak is very effective.  Excellent close up.  On a second look - I''m upping it to a 10.</td>', 'I love the softness to this shot.  The eye color is magnificent.  Your use of negative space is great - his black just fades into the background.  The lignting on his beak is very effective.  Excellent close up.  On a second look - I''m upping it to a 10.', '2005-07-18 11:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
