(1543759, 204029, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very cool!!!!   The detail on the bird is amazing, and I just love the perspective you get with him sitting on that glove.   A super close-up shot would have left me thinking he was a normal sized bird, but this lets you see how tiny and delicate he is.     Excellent job!!!!!!!</td>', 'Very cool!!!!   The detail on the bird is amazing, and I just love the perspective you get with him sitting on that glove.   A super close-up shot would have left me thinking he was a normal sized bird, but this lets you see how tiny and delicate he is.     Excellent job!!!!!!!', '2005-07-18 12:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
