(1543804, 204799, 34659, '<td valign="top">You know those shots you just keep coming back to because they have that certain je ne sais qua?  Well this one is it for me in this challenge.  It''s beautiful.  Amazingly warm tones.  I still can''t put my finger on what it is about this image that I find a little off, but the whole thing continues to grow on me.  Bumping up...</td>', 'You know those shots you just keep coming back to because they have that certain je ne sais qua?  Well this one is it for me in this challenge.  It''s beautiful.  Amazingly warm tones.  I still can''t put my finger on what it is about this image that I find a little off, but the whole thing continues to grow on me.  Bumping up...', '2005-07-18 13:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543811, 204946, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great composition &amp; DOF.  The highlights seem a bit blown out toward his back and the shadows a little dark, but they''re minor points on this shot.  Really nice work.</td>', 'Great composition & DOF.  The highlights seem a bit blown out toward his back and the shadows a little dark, but they''re minor points on this shot.  Really nice work.', '2005-07-18 13:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
