(1543829, 203359, 30018, '<td valign="top">I''m thinking the editing went too far.  The lines outlining the swan and the shadow in the water make the image look unreal.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'I''m thinking the editing went too far.  The lines outlining the swan and the shadow in the water make the image look unreal.  <5>', '2005-07-18 13:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1543834, 202728, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great DOF and composition.  The highlights seem a little blown out though (IMHO).  Only a minor point in a very good shot.  Elephants are such majestic creatures.</td>', 'Great DOF and composition.  The highlights seem a little blown out though (IMHO).  Only a minor point in a very good shot.  Elephants are such majestic creatures.', '2005-07-18 13:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
