(1544283, 205350, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 1/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>Nice job, especially with the reflection in the water. The photo is just a bit too contrasty for my taste.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Color/Contrast: 1/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 Nice job, especially with the reflection in the water. The photo is just a bit too contrasty for my taste.', '2005-07-18 16:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544284, 205051, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 2/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 2/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 2/2<br/> <br/>Great work on this! The lighting is really nice, and the photo is very crisp and clear. Cropping is perfect!</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Color/Contrast: 2/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 2/2My Subjective Affinity: 2/2 Great work on this! The lighting is really nice, and the photo is very crisp and clear. Cropping is perfect!', '2005-07-18 16:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544286, 203926, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 1/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>Nice capture. However, the head is a little blown out and the center composition doesn''t come off as well as an off-centered one. Better luck next time. Still a good photo though.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Color/Contrast: 1/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 Nice capture. However, the head is a little blown out and the center composition doesn''t come off as well as an off-centered one. Better luck next time. Still a good photo though.', '2005-07-18 16:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
