(1544289, 204761, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 1/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 0/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 0/2<br/> <br/>Too much pixelation in the backgroung. Were you forced to crop it too much? It really hurts your photo. The back (?) of the other giraffe is also distracting.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Color/Contrast: 1/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 0/2My Subjective Affinity: 0/2 Too much pixelation in the backgroung. Were you forced to crop it too much? It really hurts your photo. The back (?) of the other giraffe is also distracting.', '2005-07-18 16:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
