(1544940, 204790, 34659, '<td valign="top">VERY emotional shot.  It reminds me of some demented scientist''s laboratory from the 1930s.  Really nice work - I know that for me, whenever people tell me that a photo of mine evoked a strong feeling from them, I feel that I was successful.  Good job.</td>', 'VERY emotional shot.  It reminds me of some demented scientist''s laboratory from the 1930s.  Really nice work - I know that for me, whenever people tell me that a photo of mine evoked a strong feeling from them, I feel that I was successful.  Good job.', '2005-07-18 22:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544941, 204790, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 2/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>This photo was exposed perfect, and the elephant, even at a distance, appears so clear. However, the two things that detract from the overall image are the branch (?) hanging down over the rear of the elephant and the extra room on top and bottom of the image, above and below the rails.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Color/Contrast: 2/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 This photo was exposed perfect, and the elephant, even at a distance, appears so clear. However, the two things that detract from the overall image are the branch (?) hanging down over the rear of the elephant and the extra room on top and bottom of the image, above and below the rails.', '2005-07-18 22:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544942, 205014, 554, '<td valign="top">at the zoo, not the museum<br/>nice shot.....10</td>', 'at the zoo, not the museumnice shot.....10', '2005-07-18 22:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544944, 205289, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 1/2<br/>Composotion: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Color/Contrast: 1/2Composotion: 2/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2', '2005-07-18 22:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544949, 204941, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great DOF and color.  Not sure what it is, but something about the image seems a little off to me - maybe the crop.  It seems to have all the right elements, but they aren''t fitting together for me (if that makes any sense).  It''s a good shot, but something keeps me from scoring it higher.  (I wish I could be more descriptive and if it dawns on me later, I''ll come back and edit this comment, because I imagine all I did was frustrate you - sorry, that was not my intent.  I just wanted to be honest.)  6</td>', 'Great DOF and color.  Not sure what it is, but something about the image seems a little off to me - maybe the crop.  It seems to have all the right elements, but they aren''t fitting together for me (if that makes any sense).  It''s a good shot, but something keeps me from scoring it higher.  (I wish I could be more descriptive and if it dawns on me later, I''ll come back and edit this comment, because I imagine all I did was frustrate you - sorry, that was not my intent.  I just wanted to be honest.)  6', '2005-07-18 22:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
