(1544951, 203147, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 1/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 0/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 0/2<br/> <br/>The fence in the background is distracting. The sky is blown out. The colors are all a bit too weak. The zebra in the background is distracting. And there could have been a little more class in the photo. This is more somethin you would see in a comic section than a photograph contest. Better luck next time.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Color/Contrast: 1/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 0/2My Subjective Affinity: 0/2 The fence in the background is distracting. The sky is blown out. The colors are all a bit too weak. The zebra in the background is distracting. And there could have been a little more class in the photo. This is more somethin you would see in a comic section than a photograph contest. Better luck next time.', '2005-07-18 22:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544952, 205446, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 2/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 2/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>Nice work on this one. You did a great job isolating just the crane and eliminating the background. Good work.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Color/Contrast: 2/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 2/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 Nice work on this one. You did a great job isolating just the crane and eliminating the background. Good work.', '2005-07-18 22:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
