(1545849, 205461, 35357, '<td valign="top">And because you''re at the zoo this snack will cost you $2 per slice.  I''ll spare you the "Where''s the animal?" comment, as I''m sure you''ve had a few.  This is without a doubt, the best watermelon shot I''ve seen so far in this challenge ;-)  God luck to you, it''ll be interesting to see where the masses put this.  IMO, the composition &amp; focus are great.  I might have used a grassy background or a picnic blanket or basket behind the plate to give a more outdoorsy feel.  Good luck!</td>', 'And because you''re at the zoo this snack will cost you $2 per slice.  I''ll spare you the "Where''s the animal?" comment, as I''m sure you''ve had a few.  This is without a doubt, the best watermelon shot I''ve seen so far in this challenge ;-)  God luck to you, it''ll be interesting to see where the masses put this.  IMO, the composition & focus are great.  I might have used a grassy background or a picnic blanket or basket behind the plate to give a more outdoorsy feel.  Good luck!', '2005-07-19 09:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1545856, 204701, 35357, '<td valign="top">The colours of this beast are wonderful &amp; soothing, my favourite thing about this photo.  Awesome techs, great shot!</td>', 'The colours of this beast are wonderful & soothing, my favourite thing about this photo.  Awesome techs, great shot!', '2005-07-19 09:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1545861, 204665, 35357, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the "Golden Spiral" composition, it really struck me.  The shot seems a little too dark for my taste, but otherwise is a great catch.</td>', 'Nice use of the "Golden Spiral" composition, it really struck me.  The shot seems a little too dark for my taste, but otherwise is a great catch.', '2005-07-19 09:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1545872, 205225, 35357, '<td valign="top">Great closeup &amp; personal.  I like the dof and lighting.  I have the urge to hire CSI to find out what''s in the reflection of its eye.</td>', 'Great closeup & personal.  I like the dof and lighting.  I have the urge to hire CSI to find out what''s in the reflection of its eye.', '2005-07-19 09:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1545881, 205433, 35357, '<td valign="top">I like the textures and composition.  Kind of a Joey Lawrencesque treatment.  My only nit-pick is the slightly oof nose with a bit of blowout at the margins, but that''s just a small bit.</td>', 'I like the textures and composition.  Kind of a Joey Lawrencesque treatment.  My only nit-pick is the slightly oof nose with a bit of blowout at the margins, but that''s just a small bit.', '2005-07-19 09:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1545895, 204887, 35357, '<td valign="top">Very nice focus and depth of field.  I have a very tough time capturing shades of white without getting blown out.  IMO the lighting (flash?) is too harsh, though, causing the shadows from its head to drop onto its body.  My main complaint is the centered composition, which I don''t think works in this case.  I think your shot would be improved with a crop on the left about halfway between its eye and the edge of its feathers.  The flow would then move better from claws to beak to eye, the over the head and down the wing and out of the corner of the frame.  Of course, take all of th above with a grain of salt, as it''s just me spewing!  Good luck, I''m giving you a 6.</td>', 'Very nice focus and depth of field.  I have a very tough time capturing shades of white without getting blown out.  IMO the lighting (flash?) is too harsh, though, causing the shadows from its head to drop onto its body.  My main complaint is the centered composition, which I don''t think works in this case.  I think your shot would be improved with a crop on the left about halfway between its eye and the edge of its feathers.  The flow would then move better from claws to beak to eye, the over the head and down the wing and out of the corner of the frame.  Of course, take all of th above with a grain of salt, as it''s just me spewing!  Good luck, I''m giving you a 6.', '2005-07-19 09:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1545898, 205377, 29462, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of noise on this shot which lets it down some what, shame</td>', 'There is a lot of noise on this shot which lets it down some what, shame', '2005-07-19 09:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1545899, 203903, 35357, '<td valign="top">Whoa!  I love the balance and framing.</td>', 'Whoa!  I love the balance and framing.', '2005-07-19 09:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1545904, 205078, 35357, '<td valign="top">This is a just plain cool shot!  This would have been a top finish in the Circle challenge.  Even legs as leading lines, cool.  I like the composition too.  Great eye.</td>', 'This is a just plain cool shot!  This would have been a top finish in the Circle challenge.  Even legs as leading lines, cool.  I like the composition too.  Great eye.', '2005-07-19 09:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1545912, 204771, 10720, '<td valign="top">Good action but the moving beak (IMHO) distracts. A faster shutter speed would have been great!</td>', 'Good action but the moving beak (IMHO) distracts. A faster shutter speed would have been great!', '2005-07-19 09:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1545913, 205362, 10720, '<td valign="top">The flies are nicely lit but I dont'' like the framing.</td>', 'The flies are nicely lit but I dont'' like the framing.', '2005-07-19 09:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
