(1546078, 205014, 30605, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what''s going on, but it more look like a painting than a photo to me. From your title, it looks like it was the effect your were after. Definately look edited too much to me. Still, nice capture of the lion''s eyes</td>', 'I don''t know what''s going on, but it more look like a painting than a photo to me. From your title, it looks like it was the effect your were after. Definately look edited too much to me. Still, nice capture of the lion''s eyes', '2005-07-19 11:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
