(1546261, 205359, 24841, '<td valign="top">WOW! 10!</td>', 'WOW! 10!', '2005-07-19 13:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1546276, 205014, 37691, '<td valign="top">Wow!!! When I ran accross the shot my immediate thought was CLASSIC. What a great grab. It looksas though he justhad his mane done. You handled the obvious lighting challenge skillfully. This is a winner! imo</td>', 'Wow!!! When I ran accross the shot my immediate thought was CLASSIC. What a great grab. It looksas though he justhad his mane done. You handled the obvious lighting challenge skillfully. This is a winner! imo', '2005-07-19 13:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1546293, 205461, 27605, '<td valign="top">Having read the challenge description,  I am certainly aware that "things you might see at the zoo" are viable shots for this challenge.  Even so, I''m much more inclined to vote favorably on kids and/or animal photos... however yours is a fabulous exception and I''m glad to vote it a 9.  <br/> <br/>As for the photo itself, besides the obvious (color, focus, exposure) what I like so much is the composition, for example, the way the deep red of the watermellon starts and ends in the all-white areas of the plate and then the background.  Also like the blue/white  checkerboard being used to frame the shot.  Bravo!</td>', 'Having read the challenge description,  I am certainly aware that "things you might see at the zoo" are viable shots for this challenge.  Even so, I''m much more inclined to vote favorably on kids and/or animal photos... however yours is a fabulous exception and I''m glad to vote it a 9.   As for the photo itself, besides the obvious (color, focus, exposure) what I like so much is the composition, for example, the way the deep red of the watermellon starts and ends in the all-white areas of the plate and then the background.  Also like the blue/white  checkerboard being used to frame the shot.  Bravo!', '2005-07-19 13:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1546300, 205438, 27605, '<td valign="top">Good pic, but awesome title.  (7)</td>', 'Good pic, but awesome title.  (7)', '2005-07-19 13:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1546303, 204585, 27605, '<td valign="top">The second time in this challenge that I''ve commented about an awesome title... I don''t think there''s a better title possible for this photo! (7)</td>', 'The second time in this challenge that I''ve commented about an awesome title... I don''t think there''s a better title possible for this photo! (7)', '2005-07-19 13:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1546305, 204761, 27605, '<td valign="top">OHH!!! Poor fellow!</td>', 'OHH!!! Poor fellow!', '2005-07-19 13:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
