(1546495, 205368, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great crop &amp; composition.  You''ve got really good DOF too.  Lighting is good and it''s an endearing photo.  This is a fiercely competitive challenge!  9  (Only because there are a few others that are a hair better IMHO - in any other challenge it would probably be a 10.)</td>', 'Great crop & composition.  You''ve got really good DOF too.  Lighting is good and it''s an endearing photo.  This is a fiercely competitive challenge!  9  (Only because there are a few others that are a hair better IMHO - in any other challenge it would probably be a 10.)', '2005-07-19 14:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1546497, 204084, 38921, '<td valign="top">Very nice, a little grainy on the left half, some noise reduction would do wonders for this shot (8)</td>', 'Very nice, a little grainy on the left half, some noise reduction would do wonders for this shot (8)', '2005-07-19 14:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1546511, 205014, 34659, '<td valign="top">Is this a photo of a painting?  Something about it doesn''t look "real".  The eyes and cheek/whiskers have so much more detail than the rest of the image (and there''s a black spot underneath the lowest whisker that looks unnatural).  I like the lighting.  If this is a real lion, then I think you should give a tutorial on how you got it to look like a painting!  I''m not crazy about the eyes.  An interesting shot, nonetheless.</td>', 'Is this a photo of a painting?  Something about it doesn''t look "real".  The eyes and cheek/whiskers have so much more detail than the rest of the image (and there''s a black spot underneath the lowest whisker that looks unnatural).  I like the lighting.  If this is a real lion, then I think you should give a tutorial on how you got it to look like a painting!  I''m not crazy about the eyes.  An interesting shot, nonetheless.', '2005-07-19 14:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1546520, 205075, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very cute shot!  Looks like they''re just having a friendly conversation.  The lighting is a bit harsh though - looks like mid-day sun (very difficult to get a good shot in).  It''s neat that they have the tips of their tails in the water too.  The DOF is a little off IMHO too and the colors could use a little bump.  Still a nice shot.</td>', 'Very cute shot!  Looks like they''re just having a friendly conversation.  The lighting is a bit harsh though - looks like mid-day sun (very difficult to get a good shot in).  It''s neat that they have the tips of their tails in the water too.  The DOF is a little off IMHO too and the colors could use a little bump.  Still a nice shot.', '2005-07-19 14:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1546522, 203765, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very funny title.  Good shot of the blue-footed booby too.  You''ve got really good DOF on the adult, but it seems to fade away on the chicks.  Still a nice shot.</td>', 'Very funny title.  Good shot of the blue-footed booby too.  You''ve got really good DOF on the adult, but it seems to fade away on the chicks.  Still a nice shot.', '2005-07-19 14:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1546526, 204904, 34659, '<td valign="top">Magnificent DOF and I like the almost muted colors.  The softer focus also works well IMHO.  There are a few blown highlights on the white areas, but it''s difficult to take off much for this shot.  Very nice work.</td>', 'Magnificent DOF and I like the almost muted colors.  The softer focus also works well IMHO.  There are a few blown highlights on the white areas, but it''s difficult to take off much for this shot.  Very nice work.', '2005-07-19 14:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1546529, 205453, 34659, '<td valign="top">Something about the DOF and/or graininess of this photo that bothers me.  It''s ALMOST perfectly focused, but not quite IMHO.  Also, the lighting is pretty harsh (looks like mid-day sun), causing some blown highlights.  Still, it''s a nicely composed shot.</td>', 'Something about the DOF and/or graininess of this photo that bothers me.  It''s ALMOST perfectly focused, but not quite IMHO.  Also, the lighting is pretty harsh (looks like mid-day sun), causing some blown highlights.  Still, it''s a nicely composed shot.', '2005-07-19 14:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
