(1546588, 204469, 24454, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!!   Something a little different.   Great color tones, and I love the soft focus on the child.   Great detail in teh owl.   Good job.</td>', 'Great shot!!!   Something a little different.   Great color tones, and I love the soft focus on the child.   Great detail in teh owl.   Good job.', '2005-07-19 14:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1546589, 205193, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this one.   Love it.</td>', 'I love this one.   Love it.', '2005-07-19 14:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1546590, 205249, 34659, '<td valign="top">Stunning reflection!  Really nice job with that.  The lighting is a little harsh on the "live" bear and surroundings though - I think you could soften it a little in PS.  Wish I could see more detail, but I guess then I''d lose the beautiful reflection...  :-/<br/> <br/>Still a very nice shot and a unique one in this challenge.  It doesn''t really look like a zoo to me, but I take off no points off for that - I like the natural looking environment.  :-)  Good job.</td>', 'Stunning reflection!  Really nice job with that.  The lighting is a little harsh on the "live" bear and surroundings though - I think you could soften it a little in PS.  Wish I could see more detail, but I guess then I''d lose the beautiful reflection...  :-/ Still a very nice shot and a unique one in this challenge.  It doesn''t really look like a zoo to me, but I take off no points off for that - I like the natural looking environment.  :-)  Good job.', '2005-07-19 14:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1546594, 204513, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a regal pose.   Beautiful photo.</td>', 'What a regal pose.   Beautiful photo.', '2005-07-19 14:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1546598, 205349, 34659, '<td valign="top">Really a fantastic shot of this little guy.  Beautiful DOF and colors.  I like the background too (the greens really set off the other colors).  You''ll probably suffer from some voters who feel this isn''t a picture taken in a zoo, but not only are butterflies everywhere at zoos, I''ve even been to a butterfly zoo/sanctuary - so it works for me!  Really nice shot.</td>', 'Really a fantastic shot of this little guy.  Beautiful DOF and colors.  I like the background too (the greens really set off the other colors).  You''ll probably suffer from some voters who feel this isn''t a picture taken in a zoo, but not only are butterflies everywhere at zoos, I''ve even been to a butterfly zoo/sanctuary - so it works for me!  Really nice shot.', '2005-07-19 14:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1546602, 203753, 40855, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I really like the color contrast in this image, the brown skin against the green grass really makes the kangaroo pop out. Did you do a lot of post-processing? II think the tail of the kangaroo on the left distracts the attention too much, but I guess you didn''t have many options here. Anysway, this is a very good pic.</td>', 'Very nice!  I really like the color contrast in this image, the brown skin against the green grass really makes the kangaroo pop out. Did you do a lot of post-processing? II think the tail of the kangaroo on the left distracts the attention too much, but I guess you didn''t have many options here. Anysway, this is a very good pic.', '2005-07-19 14:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1546604, 204634, 34659, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but doesn''t look like something I''d see at a zoo to me.  Looks more like a living room.  HOWEVER, it is a very nice shot of the cat (so + points for that).</td>', 'Sorry, but doesn''t look like something I''d see at a zoo to me.  Looks more like a living room.  HOWEVER, it is a very nice shot of the cat (so + points for that).', '2005-07-19 14:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
