(1546626, 204585, 34659, '<td valign="top">What a coy looking expression with the slanted eye.  Very nice capture.  Love the pose, but think that the lighting is a little bit harsh.  Like the background and I think it''s exceptionally well composed.  Nice job.</td>', 'What a coy looking expression with the slanted eye.  Very nice capture.  Love the pose, but think that the lighting is a little bit harsh.  Like the background and I think it''s exceptionally well composed.  Nice job.', '2005-07-19 14:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
