(1548143, 203438, 35357, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and great subject.  Nicely-composed portrait. This would do MUCH better if you''d used the entire 640 pixel width allowed, but as it is it''s too small, and I''m sure it will get hammered in the voting because of that.  I suggest you take a look at the "Learn" link and find the tutorial "Using Photoshop to Prepare Photos for DPC Challenges".  You may not have that program, but it will give you a good idea of what''s up and how you might improve your submissions in the future.  Good luck to you, and I hope you continue to submit!</td>', 'Nice shot and great subject.  Nicely-composed portrait. This would do MUCH better if you''d used the entire 640 pixel width allowed, but as it is it''s too small, and I''m sure it will get hammered in the voting because of that.  I suggest you take a look at the "Learn" link and find the tutorial "Using Photoshop to Prepare Photos for DPC Challenges".  You may not have that program, but it will give you a good idea of what''s up and how you might improve your submissions in the future.  Good luck to you, and I hope you continue to submit!', '2005-07-20 00:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
