(1548432, 205381, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 0/2<br/>Composition: 0/2<br/>Photo Quality: 0/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 0/2<br/> <br/>Nice try at a unique lizard, but poorly done. Colors are too saturated on the lizard, the hand is too distracting, the focus is too soft and there is no apparent detail in the lizard.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Color/Contrast: 0/2Composition: 0/2Photo Quality: 0/2My Subjective Affinity: 0/2 Nice try at a unique lizard, but poorly done. Colors are too saturated on the lizard, the hand is too distracting, the focus is too soft and there is no apparent detail in the lizard.', '2005-07-20 01:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
