(1548909, 205287, 34217, '<td valign="top">The black in the background looks really fake, it is really hard to work with grass, so I suggest people shouldn''t do it.  It would have been great if not for that detail</td>', 'The black in the background looks really fake, it is really hard to work with grass, so I suggest people shouldn''t do it.  It would have been great if not for that detail', '2005-07-20 02:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
