(1550190, 205456, 33560, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  Unfortunately between the subject''s dark furry coat and the lighting we can see very little of her.  And while we understand that a retired star''s job is to stay out of the limelight, it is the paparazzis job to shed light on more than just her lime-lit glasses.</td>', 'Very cute.  Unfortunately between the subject''s dark furry coat and the lighting we can see very little of her.  And while we understand that a retired star''s job is to stay out of the limelight, it is the paparazzis job to shed light on more than just her lime-lit glasses.', '2005-07-20 12:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
