(1550245, 205368, 5082, '<td valign="top">This is a very good photo, one of my top three.  But I don''t like the dodging you did here... for my tastes anyway.  Either completely black out the background around the lions, or allow the light to "fall off" in the corners....  I don''t find the grass all that distracting, but the clear tracing around the females head and back draws my eyes to the dodging.  You ahve a good picture here without it.  just my two cents.</td>', 'This is a very good photo, one of my top three.  But I don''t like the dodging you did here... for my tastes anyway.  Either completely black out the background around the lions, or allow the light to "fall off" in the corners....  I don''t find the grass all that distracting, but the clear tracing around the females head and back draws my eyes to the dodging.  You ahve a good picture here without it.  just my two cents.', '2005-07-20 13:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550250, 204537, 5082, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  I have never seen colors like this on a penguin before.</td>', 'Nice capture.  I have never seen colors like this on a penguin before.', '2005-07-20 13:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550259, 204737, 5082, '<td valign="top">Nice shot... I like the processing you did on this one.</td>', 'Nice shot... I like the processing you did on this one.', '2005-07-20 13:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550263, 205098, 5082, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition on this shot, seems a bit soft but it could just be the light playing off the white fur.  My eye is drawn to the little red thing in its hand... although something tells me I don''t wanna know what it is! ;-)</td>', 'Interesting composition on this shot, seems a bit soft but it could just be the light playing off the white fur.  My eye is drawn to the little red thing in its hand... although something tells me I don''t wanna know what it is! ;-)', '2005-07-20 13:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550325, 204494, 33560, '<td valign="top">The humor in this photo is great.  I sort of wish the feet were not cut off.  And the saturation seems just slightly strong.   Finally, I wish the head of the observant fellow in the green were placed  a little more in the gap between the tall fellow and the girl in pink.  But I realize these are not things over which one has control.</td>', 'The humor in this photo is great.  I sort of wish the feet were not cut off.  And the saturation seems just slightly strong.   Finally, I wish the head of the observant fellow in the green were placed  a little more in the gap between the tall fellow and the girl in pink.  But I realize these are not things over which one has control.', '2005-07-20 13:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550330, 205085, 33560, '<td valign="top">I like the grunge aspect of this photo.  It is a refreshing change from the feel of the rest of the photos in the competition. Good Luck.</td>', 'I like the grunge aspect of this photo.  It is a refreshing change from the feel of the rest of the photos in the competition. Good Luck.', '2005-07-20 13:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550360, 205438, 33560, '<td valign="top">In dealing with DPChallenge I have come to expect good photos to be a little oversharpened.  So when I see this excellent photo I wonder whether its more natural look is  due to accident or choice.  I expect that if it were just a little sharper it would score better  here  - whether or not it would actually make it better.   Sharpness aside, I really like the gaze of this primate.  I love the way the steel fence works with the dark skin, hair and eyes.  And I am grateful for the fact that the green of the background is not very saturated - whether by accident or on purpose.  I find the cropping just a little week.  I think there is far too much space  above the eyes.  And I think the vertical element on the right and the horizontal one on the bottom  could be cropped out to some advantage. Despite all the postprocessing tweeks that could have been done to improve the photo, this is very strong shot.</td>', 'In dealing with DPChallenge I have come to expect good photos to be a little oversharpened.  So when I see this excellent photo I wonder whether its more natural look is  due to accident or choice.  I expect that if it were just a little sharper it would score better  here  - whether or not it would actually make it better.   Sharpness aside, I really like the gaze of this primate.  I love the way the steel fence works with the dark skin, hair and eyes.  And I am grateful for the fact that the green of the background is not very saturated - whether by accident or on purpose.  I find the cropping just a little week.  I think there is far too much space  above the eyes.  And I think the vertical element on the right and the horizontal one on the bottom  could be cropped out to some advantage. Despite all the postprocessing tweeks that could have been done to improve the photo, this is very strong shot.', '2005-07-20 13:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550364, 203558, 33560, '<td valign="top">What a handsome fellow.  Great lighting, crisp focus.</td>', 'What a handsome fellow.  Great lighting, crisp focus.', '2005-07-20 13:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550366, 205373, 33560, '<td valign="top">It''s a great expression.  Unfortunately the subject is dark and the lighting fails to illuminate most of his face and body.   Nor, I think is the photo well served by the large amount of negative space on the right.</td>', 'It''s a great expression.  Unfortunately the subject is dark and the lighting fails to illuminate most of his face and body.   Nor, I think is the photo well served by the large amount of negative space on the right.', '2005-07-20 13:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550372, 204790, 33560, '<td valign="top">I love the optical illusion created by the metal frame - an elephant in a box.  It''s quite wonderful.</td>', 'I love the optical illusion created by the metal frame - an elephant in a box.  It''s quite wonderful.', '2005-07-20 13:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550374, 205075, 23614, '<td valign="top">Awesome picture. One of my favorites. I like that it''s centered. Also like what it transmits to the viewer. Peace, friendship, etc... Hope it scores high!</td>', 'Awesome picture. One of my favorites. I like that it''s centered. Also like what it transmits to the viewer. Peace, friendship, etc... Hope it scores high!', '2005-07-20 14:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550381, 205391, 26756, '<td valign="top">The image is a bit noisey, probably due to low light but I wouldn''t take any points away fro that.  Might be your equipment, and maybe you don''t have Neat Image, who cares?  The important thing is you took this at a nice angle, it''s a good subject and since it''s shot through glass, the focus isn''t too bad.  I think if you had more control over the environment and light, this could have been a lot better but it''s still nice.</td>', 'The image is a bit noisey, probably due to low light but I wouldn''t take any points away fro that.  Might be your equipment, and maybe you don''t have Neat Image, who cares?  The important thing is you took this at a nice angle, it''s a good subject and since it''s shot through glass, the focus isn''t too bad.  I think if you had more control over the environment and light, this could have been a lot better but it''s still nice.', '2005-07-20 14:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550389, 202728, 25678, '<td valign="top">I wish the cropping was either closer or farther.  I''m not terribly fond of the truks of the elephants getting clipped at the cottom of the photo.  So either having teh trunks in the photo or a closer crop around the face would be nice.  Nice detailis and sharpness in the skin of the elephant</td>', 'I wish the cropping was either closer or farther.  I''m not terribly fond of the truks of the elephants getting clipped at the cottom of the photo.  So either having teh trunks in the photo or a closer crop around the face would be nice.  Nice detailis and sharpness in the skin of the elephant', '2005-07-20 14:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550394, 203815, 26756, '<td valign="top">You framed or cropped this really quite well.  Interesting textures and colors.  Focus could have been a bit sharper.</td>', 'You framed or cropped this really quite well.  Interesting textures and colors.  Focus could have been a bit sharper.', '2005-07-20 14:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
