(1550930, 204791, 12802, '<td valign="top">My favourite shot in this challegne, predict good things!!  <br/> <br/>Perfect focus, DOF is amazing.  Such a cute shot, good to see ''Asha'' with her ears wide open.<br/> <br/>Maybe I''d have liked a faster shutter speed to see what she''s trying to eat, but think more about it I like the movement too.<br/> <br/>Only distracting but, is that a person under her right ear?  (Won''t effect your mark though!)  <br/> <br/>Full marks, well deserved!  10<br/> <br/> <br/>Know it''s better than mine :-)</td>', 'My favourite shot in this challegne, predict good things!!   Perfect focus, DOF is amazing.  Such a cute shot, good to see ''Asha'' with her ears wide open. Maybe I''d have liked a faster shutter speed to see what she''s trying to eat, but think more about it I like the movement too. Only distracting but, is that a person under her right ear?  (Won''t effect your mark though!)   Full marks, well deserved!  10  Know it''s better than mine :-)', '2005-07-20 17:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
