(1550938, 203029, 12802, '<td valign="top">Another great shot in this challenge!  Clarity is brilliant, nice and sharp focus, like that it''s not dead centre.<br/> <br/>I really like how you''ve done the border, never thought of doing one like that!  Full Marks! 10</td>', 'Another great shot in this challenge!  Clarity is brilliant, nice and sharp focus, like that it''s not dead centre. I really like how you''ve done the border, never thought of doing one like that!  Full Marks! 10', '2005-07-20 17:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
