(1550942, 204976, 34192, '<td valign="top">OMG what a face!  Except for the green blade of grass in front, I love the tones in this image.  Very subdued to match the subject.  Excellent balance in that respect.  While the blade of grass is annoying, I think it helps hold the subject where he is - does that make sense?  Love the lighting.  9 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'OMG what a face!  Except for the green blade of grass in front, I love the tones in this image.  Very subdued to match the subject.  Excellent balance in that respect.  While the blade of grass is annoying, I think it helps hold the subject where he is - does that make sense?  Love the lighting.  9 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-20 17:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550944, 205352, 12802, '<td valign="top">The eyes definately have it here!!  Perfect focus, the white balance here is right one.  No over exposed areas, just how it should be done!!  10</td>', 'The eyes definately have it here!!  Perfect focus, the white balance here is right one.  No over exposed areas, just how it should be done!!  10', '2005-07-20 17:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550955, 202814, 34192, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones and lighting.  There is something just not ''quite'' right in this and I''m not sure if its the frame or the dark space.  The balance is not quite there for a 10.  I really can''t put my finger on it.  Maybe if you had cropped away some of the left side - I don''t know since I can''t see it side by side.  Anyway, the post work is excellent but I think you had an excellent image to start with.  9 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Beautiful tones and lighting.  There is something just not ''quite'' right in this and I''m not sure if its the frame or the dark space.  The balance is not quite there for a 10.  I really can''t put my finger on it.  Maybe if you had cropped away some of the left side - I don''t know since I can''t see it side by side.  Anyway, the post work is excellent but I think you had an excellent image to start with.  9 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-20 17:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550966, 205172, 34192, '<td valign="top">Love the look on his face.  And of course that he''s a redhead!.  I think the image is a little small and the crop a little tight.  However, I think the focus is great, the colors are great, the DOV and POV great.  Composition is a little static due to the tight crop.  7 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Love the look on his face.  And of course that he''s a redhead!.  I think the image is a little small and the crop a little tight.  However, I think the focus is great, the colors are great, the DOV and POV great.  Composition is a little static due to the tight crop.  7 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-20 17:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550967, 205391, 12802, '<td valign="top">Had voted this as a 7, going to explain why it isn''t higher.<br/> <br/>It''s funny, for some reason this shot has really stood out for me.  I think I''d have preferred to have seen this desaturated to look more B&amp;W or greyscale.  I do like the grain on it, think it adds something extra to it.<br/> <br/>I copied the shot to my PC and had a little play with it (hope you don''t mind)  I desaturated it, ran neat image over it to smooth out some of the grain but then sharpened it.  I then added a thin black border round the edges.  It made the scales stand out a bit more, stopped the right hand side from fading away.<br/> <br/>As I said, I do like this shot, maybe you don''t agree with the changes I''ve suggested etc, PM if you like, but I personally feel a few wee touches in PS would have helped.</td>', 'Had voted this as a 7, going to explain why it isn''t higher. It''s funny, for some reason this shot has really stood out for me.  I think I''d have preferred to have seen this desaturated to look more B&W or greyscale.  I do like the grain on it, think it adds something extra to it. I copied the shot to my PC and had a little play with it (hope you don''t mind)  I desaturated it, ran neat image over it to smooth out some of the grain but then sharpened it.  I then added a thin black border round the edges.  It made the scales stand out a bit more, stopped the right hand side from fading away. As I said, I do like this shot, maybe you don''t agree with the changes I''ve suggested etc, PM if you like, but I personally feel a few wee touches in PS would have helped.', '2005-07-20 17:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550977, 204737, 34192, '<td valign="top">Honestly, I hate the title.  It points out something I may not have noticed or cared about otherwise.  By titling the image as such, I see that as the subject of the image.  So, I will ignore the title.  I think the image is well captured - POV, Focus, DOF, lighting all excellent.  White spot on the lip could be removed post processing pushing the score even higher.  Cropped, composed well. 8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Honestly, I hate the title.  It points out something I may not have noticed or cared about otherwise.  By titling the image as such, I see that as the subject of the image.  So, I will ignore the title.  I think the image is well captured - POV, Focus, DOF, lighting all excellent.  White spot on the lip could be removed post processing pushing the score even higher.  Cropped, composed well. 8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-20 17:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550995, 204570, 34192, '<td valign="top">In spite of the cage lines this is an excellent capture.  POV good, DOF good, color/tone well done.  8 good luck in the challenge!  BTW - its not easy to get rid of that coloration where the bars are, but if you look at the original  at pixel size, select the area/areas where it occurs (tedious I know!) and do a slight level correction, it will bring those spots in line with the rest of the image.  Time consuming, I know... :)</td>', 'In spite of the cage lines this is an excellent capture.  POV good, DOF good, color/tone well done.  8 good luck in the challenge!  BTW - its not easy to get rid of that coloration where the bars are, but if you look at the original  at pixel size, select the area/areas where it occurs (tedious I know!) and do a slight level correction, it will bring those spots in line with the rest of the image.  Time consuming, I know... :)', '2005-07-20 17:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550999, 205219, 34192, '<td valign="top">Gandalf returns!  Actually, I find this incredibly amusing.  And well taken.  Tone, POV, DOF,  focus all well done. 8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Gandalf returns!  Actually, I find this incredibly amusing.  And well taken.  Tone, POV, DOF,  focus all well done. 8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-20 17:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551008, 204513, 34192, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the pictures of Mary looking at the sky.  you know, the pious Jesus Mary?  Anyway, I think this is well done.  Tones could have been a little more contrast, but I have a feeling that blew out your whites.  MAybe a selection of everything but the whites with a level adjustment would help.  The face/position/expression of this image is so powerful though - 9.  Good luck in the challenge!  BTW - like the touch of green in the back.</td>', 'Reminds me of the pictures of Mary looking at the sky.  you know, the pious Jesus Mary?  Anyway, I think this is well done.  Tones could have been a little more contrast, but I have a feeling that blew out your whites.  MAybe a selection of everything but the whites with a level adjustment would help.  The face/position/expression of this image is so powerful though - 9.  Good luck in the challenge!  BTW - like the touch of green in the back.', '2005-07-20 17:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551012, 205148, 34192, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...Camel butt.  Just what I always wanted a view of.  :)  Actually I think this is quite nice.  The tones are excellent, crop and composition are great.  Focus is dead on as is POV and DOF. 8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Hmmm...Camel butt.  Just what I always wanted a view of.  :)  Actually I think this is quite nice.  The tones are excellent, crop and composition are great.  Focus is dead on as is POV and DOF. 8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-20 17:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
