(1551873, 203380, 25397, '<td valign="top">Have you tried adjusting the curves or levels of this image? Even an autolevels and autocontrast could have improved here, but could spoil the warm light.</td>', 'Have you tried adjusting the curves or levels of this image? Even an autolevels and autocontrast could have improved here, but could spoil the warm light.', '2005-07-20 23:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
