(1552126, 204665, 30247, '<td valign="top">if you would had send this for the title circle.......def had got a ribbon...but no doubt it is equally good for zoo</td>', 'if you would had send this for the title circle.......def had got a ribbon...but no doubt it is equally good for zoo', '2005-07-21 03:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552255, 204513, 22459, '<td valign="top">This is very good image of a lion. It shows that regal and intelligent pose that lions possess although it looks like it was shot through the glass you have still maintained much of the detail and sharpness.<br/>On the downside the bright backlighting has blown out some places but still a very nice image.</td>', 'This is very good image of a lion. It shows that regal and intelligent pose that lions possess although it looks like it was shot through the glass you have still maintained much of the detail and sharpness.On the downside the bright backlighting has blown out some places but still a very nice image.', '2005-07-21 07:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552276, 204930, 25553, '<td valign="top">nice contrast reminds me of this song...lol... Ride the tiger you can see his stripes but you know he''s clean oh don''t you see what I mean<br/>Gotta get away holy diver yeah... <br/></td>', 'nice contrast reminds me of this song...lol... Ride the tiger you can see his stripes but you know he''s clean oh don''t you see what I meanGotta get away holy diver yeah... ', '2005-07-21 07:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552281, 203542, 40461, '<td valign="top">Great photo!  MESMERIZING! You captured a wonderful balance with the  texture of the rocks and the sleekness of the snow leopard. Very intense!</td>', 'Great photo!  MESMERIZING! You captured a wonderful balance with the  texture of the rocks and the sleekness of the snow leopard. Very intense!', '2005-07-21 07:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552320, 203029, 32749, '<td valign="top">I have rated this the top photo of the challenge. It is superbly clear and the composition is just right (in my eyes).<br/> <br/>2/2 meeting challenge<br/>3/3 quality<br/>3/3 composition<br/>2/2 Do I like it?<br/> <br/>Added to my favs.</td>', 'I have rated this the top photo of the challenge. It is superbly clear and the composition is just right (in my eyes). 2/2 meeting challenge3/3 quality3/3 composition2/2 Do I like it? Added to my favs.', '2005-07-21 08:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552326, 205041, 34192, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This close I would have loved to see it in color with a little looser crop.  You got a great expression/moment and the focus is good.  Not sure why you converted it to B&amp;W when the tiger''s color are so vibrant. Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Wow.  This close I would have loved to see it in color with a little looser crop.  You got a great expression/moment and the focus is good.  Not sure why you converted it to B&W when the tiger''s color are so vibrant. Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-21 08:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552329, 204073, 34192, '<td valign="top">Excellent moment to capture!  Crop, composition, color, POV, focus all good.  Not sure what if anything I would do different here.  I think this can be used for one of those anti-motivational posters, pm me if you need examples.  Could be a print... 8 - good luck int he challenge!</td>', 'Excellent moment to capture!  Crop, composition, color, POV, focus all good.  Not sure what if anything I would do different here.  I think this can be used for one of those anti-motivational posters, pm me if you need examples.  Could be a print... 8 - good luck int he challenge!', '2005-07-21 08:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552334, 204875, 34192, '<td valign="top">His head looks so unreal.  I don''t think I''ve ever seen one at this angle/this close.  Think you clicked at just the right time.  Since his feet are missing you could probably crop a little tighter on the bottom - make it more portrait like.  the detail in the face is stunning.  I think a boost to the saturation of the greens might also improve this - it would add vibrant color that owuld contrast so well with his fur.  Excellent capture - 7 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'His head looks so unreal.  I don''t think I''ve ever seen one at this angle/this close.  Think you clicked at just the right time.  Since his feet are missing you could probably crop a little tighter on the bottom - make it more portrait like.  the detail in the face is stunning.  I think a boost to the saturation of the greens might also improve this - it would add vibrant color that owuld contrast so well with his fur.  Excellent capture - 7 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-21 08:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552347, 205452, 35357, '<td valign="top">The composition is pretty nice for a portrait of the girl, who''s face, by the way, is cute enough to be on a cereal box.  The focus and dof are very nice for the girl, but seem to miss the beast.  Maybe it''s due in part to the lack of contrast with of the dark beast with the dark background just behind it.  I like the story, because a day at the zoo all about kids and the wild kingdom, even better if they have the chance to interact.</td>', 'The composition is pretty nice for a portrait of the girl, who''s face, by the way, is cute enough to be on a cereal box.  The focus and dof are very nice for the girl, but seem to miss the beast.  Maybe it''s due in part to the lack of contrast with of the dark beast with the dark background just behind it.  I like the story, because a day at the zoo all about kids and the wild kingdom, even better if they have the chance to interact.', '2005-07-21 09:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552351, 204567, 34192, '<td valign="top">excellent lighting.  great composition. 7 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'excellent lighting.  great composition. 7 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-21 09:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552358, 205075, 34192, '<td valign="top">I don''t know, I think they are telling funny jokes about the tourists passing by below them. :)  The lighting is definitely what makes this image - Well captured. Crop, composition, focus all good.  Tones good for the subject. 7 - Goodluck in the challenge!</td>', 'I don''t know, I think they are telling funny jokes about the tourists passing by below them. :)  The lighting is definitely what makes this image - Well captured. Crop, composition, focus all good.  Tones good for the subject. 7 - Goodluck in the challenge!', '2005-07-21 09:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552390, 204343, 30187, '<td valign="top">great pic although the foreground grass spoils the focus of the shot in my opinion</td>', 'great pic although the foreground grass spoils the focus of the shot in my opinion', '2005-07-21 09:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552398, 204790, 16241, '<td valign="top">10 for originality.</td>', '10 for originality.', '2005-07-21 09:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552673, 204494, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is positively eerie. Odd cropping, oversaturated, who cares? 8 for originality alone. San Diego Zoo?</td>', 'This is positively eerie. Odd cropping, oversaturated, who cares? 8 for originality alone. San Diego Zoo?', '2005-07-21 12:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552678, 205148, 30861, '<td valign="top">Extraordinary POV on a camel, wonderful oddball composition. Love the knees (are they knees?). 8, and good luck. I''m tired of pretty "eye candy" right now.</td>', 'Extraordinary POV on a camel, wonderful oddball composition. Love the knees (are they knees?). 8, and good luck. I''m tired of pretty "eye candy" right now.', '2005-07-21 12:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552792, 203005, 10720, '<td valign="top">Very nice lion shot, a but blown out on the chest and the shadows are harsh (could have used some fill flash) Very nice framing. - 6</td>', 'Very nice lion shot, a but blown out on the chest and the shadows are harsh (could have used some fill flash) Very nice framing. - 6', '2005-07-21 13:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552794, 205429, 10720, '<td valign="top">The selective B&amp;W doesn''t really work for me in thsi shot. - 5</td>', 'The selective B&W doesn''t really work for me in thsi shot. - 5', '2005-07-21 13:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552797, 204620, 10720, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF, texture, the background by the beak is a bit distracting. Very exotic animal if not one typical seen as a zoo animal. - 6</td>', 'Nice DOF, texture, the background by the beak is a bit distracting. Very exotic animal if not one typical seen as a zoo animal. - 6', '2005-07-21 13:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552799, 205052, 10720, '<td valign="top">background is quite distracting. I like the DOF, and the eye highlight. - 5</td>', 'background is quite distracting. I like the DOF, and the eye highlight. - 5', '2005-07-21 13:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552800, 203787, 10720, '<td valign="top">Technical fine shot, but doesn''t give me the wow factor. Not an exotic animal typically seen in zoos - 5</td>', 'Technical fine shot, but doesn''t give me the wow factor. Not an exotic animal typically seen in zoos - 5', '2005-07-21 13:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552802, 205438, 10720, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, the eyes seem a bit blurry, not sure if moved or dof issue. - 6</td>', 'Nice idea, the eyes seem a bit blurry, not sure if moved or dof issue. - 6', '2005-07-21 13:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552805, 204790, 10720, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of framing. The elephant looks very flat to me, not sure if a color version would help or not. Else Good technically - 5</td>', 'Interesting use of framing. The elephant looks very flat to me, not sure if a color version would help or not. Else Good technically - 5', '2005-07-21 13:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552809, 205384, 10720, '<td valign="top">Cute, not sure about framing and cut off of the bottom of the container - 3</td>', 'Cute, not sure about framing and cut off of the bottom of the container - 3', '2005-07-21 13:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552827, 205357, 17203, '<td valign="top">An interesting subject with great color and sharpness. DOF and exposure are also quite good. You probably should have positioned the bird more to the right for a better composition. I don''t often comment on titles, but with the popularity of those yellow plastic bracelets, "Livestrong" would have made a great title. ;-) 7</td>', 'An interesting subject with great color and sharpness. DOF and exposure are also quite good. You probably should have positioned the bird more to the right for a better composition. I don''t often comment on titles, but with the popularity of those yellow plastic bracelets, "Livestrong" would have made a great title. ;-) 7', '2005-07-21 14:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552829, 205249, 41072, '<td valign="top">Great Reflection, Ma fave animal is a bear and this good pic so it gets 9</td>', 'Great Reflection, Ma fave animal is a bear and this good pic so it gets 9', '2005-07-21 14:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552831, 204737, 17203, '<td valign="top">One of the best of the bunch. Composition, color, exposure, and focus are all very good. A less "bored" expression would have been nice, but that''s kinda'' hard to control. ;-)</td>', 'One of the best of the bunch. Composition, color, exposure, and focus are all very good. A less "bored" expression would have been nice, but that''s kinda'' hard to control. ;-)', '2005-07-21 14:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552835, 205219, 17203, '<td valign="top">Very funny scene. The composition could be improved IMO if the orangutan were shifted more towards the bottom right corner, and I can''t BELIEVE you didn''t play up the situation with a clever title. Still one of the better entries in this challenge.</td>', 'Very funny scene. The composition could be improved IMO if the orangutan were shifted more towards the bottom right corner, and I can''t BELIEVE you didn''t play up the situation with a clever title. Still one of the better entries in this challenge.', '2005-07-21 14:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552840, 205109, 17203, '<td valign="top">An interesting animal captured with good sharpness and color. The expression is ho-hum and I might have cropped it a bit more off-centered, but the outstanding DOF and bokeh really make this shot (I smell an expensive lens at work). The result is almost three-dimensional, and that will make it stand out from most of the other entries.</td>', 'An interesting animal captured with good sharpness and color. The expression is ho-hum and I might have cropped it a bit more off-centered, but the outstanding DOF and bokeh really make this shot (I smell an expensive lens at work). The result is almost three-dimensional, and that will make it stand out from most of the other entries.', '2005-07-21 14:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552845, 203029, 17203, '<td valign="top">Stunning. One of the sharpest raptor shots I''ve seen. Composition is quite good, although a tighter, vertical crop might have had even more impact. Should make the top 10 easily. 9</td>', 'Stunning. One of the sharpest raptor shots I''ve seen. Composition is quite good, although a tighter, vertical crop might have had even more impact. Should make the top 10 easily. 9', '2005-07-21 14:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552851, 205386, 17203, '<td valign="top">Beautiful birds, well-composed and presented. One of the better images in this group. 8</td>', 'Beautiful birds, well-composed and presented. One of the better images in this group. 8', '2005-07-21 14:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552852, 204141, 17203, '<td valign="top">A little soft for my taste, but the dramatic colors are wonderful. Excellent work. 8</td>', 'A little soft for my taste, but the dramatic colors are wonderful. Excellent work. 8', '2005-07-21 14:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1553221, 204920, 5286, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is excellent. You''ve captured a real animal look in his eyes. Excellent crop, excellent light, excellent everything. This is a picture that speaks. 10. I also wish you a ribbon :)</td>', 'Wow, this is excellent. You''ve captured a real animal look in his eyes. Excellent crop, excellent light, excellent everything. This is a picture that speaks. 10. I also wish you a ribbon :)', '2005-07-21 18:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1553223, 204246, 5286, '<td valign="top">A capture of real emotion. Beautifully composed too. One of my favorites :)</td>', 'A capture of real emotion. Beautifully composed too. One of my favorites :)', '2005-07-21 18:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1553227, 204073, 5286, '<td valign="top">Scary! Nice focus and timing. Wonder if it''s a tad oversharpened though?</td>', 'Scary! Nice focus and timing. Wonder if it''s a tad oversharpened though?', '2005-07-21 18:35:41.000000', NULL, 1);
