(1553825, 204791, 2780, '<td valign="top">The blurred background looks really badly done, and it''s a real distraction, sorry. Most photoshopped blackgrounds do, since the transition is too quick, and doesn''t progress going backwards, and it too soft. Also, the characteristics of real blur are not present. If you have Photoshop CS try using an alpha layer to set distances and use the ''Lens Blur'' tool for a much more realistic effect.</td>', 'The blurred background looks really badly done, and it''s a real distraction, sorry. Most photoshopped blackgrounds do, since the transition is too quick, and doesn''t progress going backwards, and it too soft. Also, the characteristics of real blur are not present. If you have Photoshop CS try using an alpha layer to set distances and use the ''Lens Blur'' tool for a much more realistic effect.', '2005-07-21 22:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
