(1554463, 205219, 30881, '<td valign="top">When hunting for the perfect subject to photograph, its very rare to find anything close to this without adding props. Just a great image. Texture in staff and blankey is great, lighting effects are also near perfect. If I was to get picky I''d like to see that tiny bit of green in upper right corner turn white like the rest of background. This deserves to be in top three In my opinion this is a 10</td>', 'When hunting for the perfect subject to photograph, its very rare to find anything close to this without adding props. Just a great image. Texture in staff and blankey is great, lighting effects are also near perfect. If I was to get picky I''d like to see that tiny bit of green in upper right corner turn white like the rest of background. This deserves to be in top three In my opinion this is a 10', '2005-07-22 08:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554472, 205368, 30881, '<td valign="top">Usually zoo animals look so sad being caged up, however this shot shows love affectection contentment. Excellent find. Nice sharp clear image and the lighting  running down the females jaw works well with his darker face. This deserves to be a top 3 finish. I offer you my "10". Obviously the "king" enjoys being fussed over too! lol</td>', 'Usually zoo animals look so sad being caged up, however this shot shows love affectection contentment. Excellent find. Nice sharp clear image and the lighting  running down the females jaw works well with his darker face. This deserves to be a top 3 finish. I offer you my "10". Obviously the "king" enjoys being fussed over too! lol', '2005-07-22 08:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554480, 205255, 35357, '<td valign="top">UG!  I brought my kids to the museum and we were saving their favourite exhibit until last.  At the end of our tour we were pumped to go, but they''d put up a sign just like that.  I flipped out!  We got our money back for the day, but who cares about that?  Anyway... nicely composed, different, &amp; creative.  Though not a whole lot of interest except for passing your frustration on to me, LOL.  Good job &amp; congrats on your unique photo.</td>', 'UG!  I brought my kids to the museum and we were saving their favourite exhibit until last.  At the end of our tour we were pumped to go, but they''d put up a sign just like that.  I flipped out!  We got our money back for the day, but who cares about that?  Anyway... nicely composed, different, & creative.  Though not a whole lot of interest except for passing your frustration on to me, LOL.  Good job & congrats on your unique photo.', '2005-07-22 08:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554488, 204641, 30881, '<td valign="top">Great timing. A very cute subject. Really like the different color shades in main subject but I find the bright white glare on the rope and bottom right corner of picture very distracting. A great shot however and should get a top 10 finish. Congrats!</td>', 'Great timing. A very cute subject. Really like the different color shades in main subject but I find the bright white glare on the rope and bottom right corner of picture very distracting. A great shot however and should get a top 10 finish. Congrats!', '2005-07-22 09:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554489, 204084, 35357, '<td valign="top">This is definitely the Blue Ribbon shot right here.  I''m sure of it.  If you don''t win the Blue Ribbon I''m going to find a high tower and jump off of it!  I would tell you how amazing this shot is, but I''m sure you''ve already had a hundred comments to that effect.  I''m even having trouble believing this is an actual, living tiger.  Of course, if it''s a stuffed tiger I''d want to take my 10 back. [10]</td>', 'This is definitely the Blue Ribbon shot right here.  I''m sure of it.  If you don''t win the Blue Ribbon I''m going to find a high tower and jump off of it!  I would tell you how amazing this shot is, but I''m sure you''ve already had a hundred comments to that effect.  I''m even having trouble believing this is an actual, living tiger.  Of course, if it''s a stuffed tiger I''d want to take my 10 back. [10]', '2005-07-22 09:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554493, 204246, 35357, '<td valign="top">This is definitely the cutest shot of the challenge, a real poster-shot!  I think everything about it is just perfect and I''m picking it as a Ribbon-winner.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is definitely the cutest shot of the challenge, a real poster-shot!  I think everything about it is just perfect and I''m picking it as a Ribbon-winner.  Good luck!', '2005-07-22 09:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
