(1555439, 203029, 34396, '<td valign="top">I love this photo.  I don''t care at all for the borders that have been added, or the cropping.  I think there are some photos which can ignore the "rule of thirds" and this is one of them.  I would have eliminated the  borders and cropped the right side, focusing more on the eagle.  9<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-25 00:10:57.</i></td>', 'I love this photo.  I don''t care at all for the borders that have been added, or the cropping.  I think there are some photos which can ignore the "rule of thirds" and this is one of them.  I would have eliminated the  borders and cropped the right side, focusing more on the eagle.  9', '2005-07-22 16:38:31.000000', '2005-07-25 01:10:57.000000', 1),
