(1557236, 204176, 19978, '<td valign="top">Love the stab at humor, even though many Nikon photographers give me gas... I like the way you''ve filled the frame, though closeups like this seem to require that n''th bit of sharpness which yours lacks. You''re probably getting tons of comments about that, right? Nice job at the zoo, good luck!</td>', 'Love the stab at humor, even though many Nikon photographers give me gas... I like the way you''ve filled the frame, though closeups like this seem to require that n''th bit of sharpness which yours lacks. You''re probably getting tons of comments about that, right? Nice job at the zoo, good luck!', '2005-07-23 14:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1557237, 203815, 19978, '<td valign="top">I considered a shot like this myself. I wish his eye had been open. Nice job tho...</td>', 'I considered a shot like this myself. I wish his eye had been open. Nice job tho...', '2005-07-23 14:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1557297, 205014, 25553, '<td valign="top">the painting look is cool. howd you do it?  im not too fond of the feet though..</td>', 'the painting look is cool. howd you do it?  im not too fond of the feet though..', '2005-07-23 15:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1557302, 204701, 25553, '<td valign="top">great title! i like the smoothness of the fur.</td>', 'great title! i like the smoothness of the fur.', '2005-07-23 15:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1557416, 204246, 41098, '<td valign="top">Wow, the fact that one is at a zoo means there is initially a ton against you that you cannot change. I seem to think everything from the background to the focus is just as one would do it in their own studio. You have great eye for detail and emotion and the cub tells it all. Great capture with good balance and color. You have my vote.</td>', 'Wow, the fact that one is at a zoo means there is initially a ton against you that you cannot change. I seem to think everything from the background to the focus is just as one would do it in their own studio. You have great eye for detail and emotion and the cub tells it all. Great capture with good balance and color. You have my vote.', '2005-07-23 16:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1557420, 205075, 41098, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite photo simply because it tells a concept and story, it doesnt'' just show a picture. The human like quality of the Lemer is amazing and his little fingers are meditating! I''ve learned timing is the key to mastering great photography because it is luck and eye and cannot be taught. This picture does just that - shows great timing.</td>', 'This is my favorite photo simply because it tells a concept and story, it doesnt'' just show a picture. The human like quality of the Lemer is amazing and his little fingers are meditating! I''ve learned timing is the key to mastering great photography because it is luck and eye and cannot be taught. This picture does just that - shows great timing.', '2005-07-23 16:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1557422, 205226, 41098, '<td valign="top">Ick, he is struggling! I love the focus on the gorilla with the use of a blur background and his texture is amazing. This photo shows just how human-like animals all are and that we all suffer from the "fly in the eye" sometimes. Great capture.</td>', 'Ick, he is struggling! I love the focus on the gorilla with the use of a blur background and his texture is amazing. This photo shows just how human-like animals all are and that we all suffer from the "fly in the eye" sometimes. Great capture.', '2005-07-23 17:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1557423, 205076, 41098, '<td valign="top">How did you get so close to this guy!? I love the perspective, it shows a lot of character and emotion and his face truely is telling the story. I love the colors of the grass contrasting with his black and whites and the human-like pose he has. Great timing and eye for a good picture.</td>', 'How did you get so close to this guy!? I love the perspective, it shows a lot of character and emotion and his face truely is telling the story. I love the colors of the grass contrasting with his black and whites and the human-like pose he has. Great timing and eye for a good picture.', '2005-07-23 17:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1557427, 203855, 41098, '<td valign="top">Great close up, but it needs more focus.</td>', 'Great close up, but it needs more focus.', '2005-07-23 17:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1557429, 205244, 41098, '<td valign="top">What emotion... and great texture. I really like the poor guy''s face.</td>', 'What emotion... and great texture. I really like the poor guy''s face.', '2005-07-23 17:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1557431, 204674, 41098, '<td valign="top">It seems to have a dreamy effect, out of focus or added? I love the colors and his gaze of laziness. Good picture.</td>', 'It seems to have a dreamy effect, out of focus or added? I love the colors and his gaze of laziness. Good picture.', '2005-07-23 17:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1557433, 204467, 41098, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo and really sends an "ick" to its onlookers. The roach could be in better focus with a background of all popcorn with better lighting. I think the concept is great and perhaps I will be doing one similar.</td>', 'This is a great photo and really sends an "ick" to its onlookers. The roach could be in better focus with a background of all popcorn with better lighting. I think the concept is great and perhaps I will be doing one similar.', '2005-07-23 17:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1557435, 204875, 41098, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a great demeanor for this cat to be carrying. Good focus and use of background and good perspective (being eye to eye).</td>', 'Wow, what a great demeanor for this cat to be carrying. Good focus and use of background and good perspective (being eye to eye).', '2005-07-23 17:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1557437, 203753, 41098, '<td valign="top">This picture seems to be on a hill? However, I love the mom kangaroo and her little Joey and this is really a rare animal to be captured at zoos. Great color but perhpas te lighting could have been more just.</td>', 'This picture seems to be on a hill? However, I love the mom kangaroo and her little Joey and this is really a rare animal to be captured at zoos. Great color but perhpas te lighting could have been more just.', '2005-07-23 17:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1557438, 205396, 41098, '<td valign="top">The baby koala is too cute but the mom''s face is out of reach to be seen. The lack of colors in the Koala draw my eye to the big branch and I know that isn''t the focal point, but I couldn''t help it.</td>', 'The baby koala is too cute but the mom''s face is out of reach to be seen. The lack of colors in the Koala draw my eye to the big branch and I know that isn''t the focal point, but I couldn''t help it.', '2005-07-23 17:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1557440, 205384, 41098, '<td valign="top">Out on a limb, I respect that. Good title and picture but its very dark. Perhaps if the monkey was looking directly at the camera it could appear more life-like.</td>', 'Out on a limb, I respect that. Good title and picture but its very dark. Perhaps if the monkey was looking directly at the camera it could appear more life-like.', '2005-07-23 17:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1557441, 203147, 41098, '<td valign="top">Horrible background, but you are at a zoo (don''t you hate that). Good timing and interesting you would submit this one. ;)</td>', 'Horrible background, but you are at a zoo (don''t you hate that). Good timing and interesting you would submit this one. ;)', '2005-07-23 17:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1557445, 204911, 41098, '<td valign="top">I think my focus was on the concept the tag had for me. He looks so gentle and innocent and then there is this unnatural tag on his fin. :( I love the timing and texture but I wish I could see his face.</td>', 'I think my focus was on the concept the tag had for me. He looks so gentle and innocent and then there is this unnatural tag on his fin. :( I love the timing and texture but I wish I could see his face.', '2005-07-23 17:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1557447, 202814, 41098, '<td valign="top">Looks like this is right out of a poster. Great lighting and perspective. Very balanced and texturized. I love it.</td>', 'Looks like this is right out of a poster. Great lighting and perspective. Very balanced and texturized. I love it.', '2005-07-23 17:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1557453, 205349, 41098, '<td valign="top">I so respect the patience and balace it takes to do Macro. Good background and color usage and I like the eyes. Perhaps he could have been front and center.</td>', 'I so respect the patience and balace it takes to do Macro. Good background and color usage and I like the eyes. Perhaps he could have been front and center.', '2005-07-23 17:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1557454, 205148, 41098, '<td valign="top">Great perspective... the butt and looking back.</td>', 'Great perspective... the butt and looking back.', '2005-07-23 17:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1557455, 203153, 41098, '<td valign="top">I didn''t like the background color, it made me mad for some reason. I dunno. I do like the concept and timing of a fight though, interesting.</td>', 'I didn''t like the background color, it made me mad for some reason. I dunno. I do like the concept and timing of a fight though, interesting.', '2005-07-23 17:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
