(1557458, 205433, 41098, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell with all the textures if he''s out of focus or if the picture is just that cool. I love his eye as the focal point.</td>', 'I can''t tell with all the textures if he''s out of focus or if the picture is just that cool. I love his eye as the focal point.', '2005-07-23 17:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1557460, 205249, 41098, '<td valign="top">I simply love reflections so I am biased.</td>', 'I simply love reflections so I am biased.', '2005-07-23 17:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
