(1560077, 204246, 22734, '<td valign="top">And how about that! This was my pick. I gave it ten at first sight. Shannon you have simply outdone yourself here so complete that it will be a rough climb up to beat this effort. Of course, your talent knows no bounds so you may prove me wrong.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on your blue. I have yet to see an image that has illicited so many tender emotions as this image. This is the emotive of the emotive family, though I must be careful because family here means mom, dad and kids and not categoties or bulbs. lol<br/> <br/>You have brought to DPC one darn unforgettable image and I am happy to have the honor to have met the man behind this wonderful talent.</td>', 'And how about that! This was my pick. I gave it ten at first sight. Shannon you have simply outdone yourself here so complete that it will be a rough climb up to beat this effort. Of course, your talent knows no bounds so you may prove me wrong. Congratulations on your blue. I have yet to see an image that has illicited so many tender emotions as this image. This is the emotive of the emotive family, though I must be careful because family here means mom, dad and kids and not categoties or bulbs. lol You have brought to DPC one darn unforgettable image and I am happy to have the honor to have met the man behind this wonderful talent.', '2005-07-25 01:07:37.000000', NULL, 0),
