(1561649, 203542, 23962, '<td valign="top">I can''t beleive this shot did not get a ribbon. Everything you''ve done here is good. The soft focus works and I am so glad you centred the subject. Stay away from trendy compositions and trust yourself. I am curious if you took a lot of shots. Was there one where the leopard''s ears were up.<br/>Great stuff<br/>Your profile pic is not so good.<br/>Kevin</td>', 'I can''t beleive this shot did not get a ribbon. Everything you''ve done here is good. The soft focus works and I am so glad you centred the subject. Stay away from trendy compositions and trust yourself. I am curious if you took a lot of shots. Was there one where the leopard''s ears were up.Great stuffYour profile pic is not so good.Kevin', '2005-07-25 13:39:15.000000', NULL, 0);
