(1565282, 205462, 34539, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by 2Shay:</b></div><hr/><i> Great focus on the head of this cheetah!  I love the motion this photo conveys.  It reminds me of kids chasing an Ice Cream Truck!  Was there something on the other side of the fence that the cat was chasing? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes, there is something!  My daughter!  The cheetahs were all very lazy in the hot sun so my daughter ran back and forth along the fence and they started pacing, then chasing her!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-26 23:10:39.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by 2Shay: Great focus on the head of this cheetah!  I love the motion this photo conveys.  It reminds me of kids chasing an Ice Cream Truck!  Was there something on the other side of the fence that the cat was chasing?   Yes, there is something!  My daughter!  The cheetahs were all very lazy in the hot sun so my daughter ran back and forth along the fence and they started pacing, then chasing her!', '2005-07-27 00:09:42.000000', '2005-07-27 00:10:39.000000', 0),
