(1620938, 205261, 39483, '<td valign="top">Great shot!! I love his stare and the capture is excellent in terms of lighting and sharpness! His whiskers and nose really do seem to pop out of the photo :) I do think however that the background takes away from the beauty of the animal itself... I wonder how it looks even more cropped so you only see the center of his face and none of the greenery (you''d loose his ears though)... a tad more of USM also, especially around the eyes? <br/>Very well done!</td>', 'Great shot!! I love his stare and the capture is excellent in terms of lighting and sharpness! His whiskers and nose really do seem to pop out of the photo :) I do think however that the background takes away from the beauty of the animal itself... I wonder how it looks even more cropped so you only see the center of his face and none of the greenery (you''d loose his ears though)... a tad more of USM also, especially around the eyes? Very well done!', '2005-08-18 10:45:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(1621214, 205261, 41725, '<td valign="top">First i''d like to thank you for the nice comment you left for me.(pertaining to the waterfall entry in live music) I guess most people don''t appreciate nature at it''s finest,your comment suggests that you do and it also says a lot about you.I can tell from your photos that you like the finer things in life,and have love and respect for mother nature.<br/>I can''t believe how mnay rude people i have met here,don''t they realise that if they leave me a nasty comment that i will only return their favour? not very smart people if you ask me!<br/>You have some very nice photos in your album,thank you for sharing them.<br/>i want to be removed from dp challenge,it will ruin my reputation as a professional photographer,anyone that reads this can you ask them to remove me please,i have already spoken to them and they won''t remove me,so i guess i have to cause a scene to be removed.so be it,if that''s what it will take.thanx for your time and have a nice day</td>', 'First i''d like to thank you for the nice comment you left for me.(pertaining to the waterfall entry in live music) I guess most people don''t appreciate nature at it''s finest,your comment suggests that you do and it also says a lot about you.I can tell from your photos that you like the finer things in life,and have love and respect for mother nature.I can''t believe how mnay rude people i have met here,don''t they realise that if they leave me a nasty comment that i will only return their favour? not very smart people if you ask me!You have some very nice photos in your album,thank you for sharing them.i want to be removed from dp challenge,it will ruin my reputation as a professional photographer,anyone that reads this can you ask them to remove me please,i have already spoken to them and they won''t remove me,so i guess i have to cause a scene to be removed.so be it,if that''s what it will take.thanx for your time and have a nice day', '2005-08-18 12:50:20.000000', NULL, 0),
