(2260595, 203542, 34938, '<td valign="top">This is brilliant Jason...I love what you have done to this photo in photoshop...interesting choice of lens that has carried the shot off well...a macro lens would not have been the lens I would have pulled out of the bag, but I''ll need to think again after seeing this...that''s an amazing photograph. I particularly like the sharpness in the face. as someone else has mentioned...mesmerising. Definitely the very best snow leopard shot I have seen</td>', 'This is brilliant Jason...I love what you have done to this photo in photoshop...interesting choice of lens that has carried the shot off well...a macro lens would not have been the lens I would have pulled out of the bag, but I''ll need to think again after seeing this...that''s an amazing photograph. I particularly like the sharpness in the face. as someone else has mentioned...mesmerising. Definitely the very best snow leopard shot I have seen', '2006-03-26 18:44:34.000000', NULL, 0),
