(2394046, 205250, 34659, '<td valign="top">Ya know, I scored this a 5 during the challenge, but I think it has an awful lot of potential.  Your focus and DOF are good - and you''ve got a good natural color base.  The shot comes across as a little on the dull side though IMHO.  I think if you bumped up the exposure in PP (not sure what editing software you use), increased the contrast &amp; color sat, then did a little selective burning, you could make this puppy pop quite a bit more.  It''s a very cute pic and technically pretty sound.  :-)</td>', 'Ya know, I scored this a 5 during the challenge, but I think it has an awful lot of potential.  Your focus and DOF are good - and you''ve got a good natural color base.  The shot comes across as a little on the dull side though IMHO.  I think if you bumped up the exposure in PP (not sure what editing software you use), increased the contrast & color sat, then did a little selective burning, you could make this puppy pop quite a bit more.  It''s a very cute pic and technically pretty sound.  :-)', '2006-05-08 16:20:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2394843, 205250, 49652, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is just precious.</td>', 'Oh, this is just precious.', '2006-05-08 20:47:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2411950, 205261, 58665, '<td valign="top">I love the fact that you are not quite sure what is going on behind those gorgeous eyes!  Beautiful crispness to your shot, great reward, for your effort!</td>', 'I love the fact that you are not quite sure what is going on behind those gorgeous eyes!  Beautiful crispness to your shot, great reward, for your effort!', '2006-05-13 11:03:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2419735, 205261, 50674, '<td valign="top">For an Icelander, this is scary stuff, glad you two met at the zoo.<br/> <br/>Truly wonderful colours and I love that the animal is so close and we get to see the look in his eyes, "what are you doing on my turf".</td>', 'For an Icelander, this is scary stuff, glad you two met at the zoo. Truly wonderful colours and I love that the animal is so close and we get to see the look in his eyes, "what are you doing on my turf".', '2006-05-16 04:09:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2455912, 204246, 59550, '<td valign="top">a wonderful piece of work.</td>', 'a wonderful piece of work.', '2006-05-25 08:40:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2468898, 204476, 10720, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by donniev:</b></div><hr/><i> Just as a point of information. This is a female Eclectus, native to the Solomon islands. They are one of the few parrot species which can be sexed by color. The males are green with an orange beak. (I have one of each :-) ) Beautiful shot. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks the local zoo actually has one of each sex, so I have pictures of the red and green together :-)</td>', 'Originally posted by donniev: Just as a point of information. This is a female Eclectus, native to the Solomon islands. They are one of the few parrot species which can be sexed by color. The males are green with an orange beak. (I have one of each :-) ) Beautiful shot.  Thanks the local zoo actually has one of each sex, so I have pictures of the red and green together :-)', '2006-05-30 16:09:52.000000', NULL, 0),
