(6527024, 204029, 120666, '<td valign="top">I don''t see grain either, great image, I love how small the owl is and how gnarled and thick the glove is. <br/>Something captivating in his eyes and posture. Don''t let his size fool you! This bird is a Killer! Well done.</td>', 'I don''t see grain either, great image, I love how small the owl is and how gnarled and thick the glove is. Something captivating in his eyes and posture. Don''t let his size fool you! This bird is a Killer! Well done.', '2011-09-04 08:48:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6590290, 204246, 130126, '<td valign="top">awwww this is so so cute...and so so sad at the same time..this is how a person would look when she/he is terribly missing a loved one..i can really feel its pain.you captured this expression on the cute cub with such precision. great job!</td>', 'awwww this is so so cute...and so so sad at the same time..this is how a person would look when she/he is terribly missing a loved one..i can really feel its pain.you captured this expression on the cute cub with such precision. great job!', '2011-11-09 05:52:46.000000', NULL, 0),
